---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | TOYFACTORY">
  <main class="pt-40 pb-32 bg-[#0A0A0F] min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-8">
      <h1 class="text-5xl font-display font-extrabold text-white mb-16 uppercase italic">Privacy <span class="text-gold">Policy.</span></h1>
      
      <div class="space-y-12 text-gray-400 leading-relaxed uppercase tracking-wide text-xs">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-white text-lg font-bold mb-6 italic">1. DATA COLLECTION</h2>
          <p>WE COLLECT BUSINESS INFORMATION (COMPANY NAME, CONTACT EMAIL, AND PROJECT REQUIREMENTS) EXCLUSIVELY FOR THE PURPOSE OF PROVIDING MANUFACTURING QUOTES AND PROCESSING ORDERS. WE DO NOT SELL OR SHARE YOUR DATA WITH THIRD-PARTY MARKETING AGENCIES.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-white text-lg font-bold mb-6 italic">2. CONFIDENTIALITY</h2>
          <p>ANY PROPRIETARY DESIGNS, CUSTOM MOLDS, OR BRAND ASSETS SHARED DURING THE OEM/ODM PROCESS ARE TREATED AS STRICTLY CONFIDENTIAL. WE ADHERE TO RIGOROUS IP PROTECTION STANDARDS TO ENSURE YOUR DESIGNS REMAIN YOUR EXCLUSIVE PROPERTY.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-white text-lg font-bold mb-6 italic">3. COOKIES & TRACKING</h2>
          <p>OUR WEBSITE USES MINIMAL ANALYTICAL COOKIES TO IMPROVE BROWSING EXPERIENCE AND MONITOR SITE PERFORMANCE. NO PERSONALLY IDENTIFIABLE INFORMATION IS STORED VIA THESE TOOLS.</p>
        </section>

        <div class="pt-12 border-t border-white/10">
          <a href="/" class="text-gold hover:text-white transition-colors font-bold">&larr; BACK TO HOME</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
